      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안심은 되지만 조금 헛헛하기도 하군.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n뿔충이들과의 실랑이가 어느샌가\n삶의 재미가 되었던 것일지도 모르겠구먼.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C2ECC7400020B418C9C0B9CC0020C870AE080020D5DBD5DBD558AE30B3C40020D558AD70002E00100001BE01000ABFD4CDA9C774B4E4ACFCC7580020C2E4B791C774AC000020C5B4B290C0CCAC00000AC0B6C7580020C7ACBBF8AC000020B418C5C8B3580020AC83C77CC9C0B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0AD6CBA3C002E001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자네, 괜찮다면\n우두머리 뿔충이를 내게 주지 않겠나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790B124002C0020AD1CCC2EB2E4BA74000AC6B0B450BA38B9AC0020BFD4CDA9C774B97C0020B0B4AC8C0020C8FCC9C00020C54AACA0B098003F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
